- [Emulating SQL Server Database Mail in PostgreSQL with an extension pack](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/SchemaConversionTool/latest/userguide/CHAP_Source.SQLServer.ToPostgreSQL.ExtensionPack.Mail.md): Use an AWS Schema Conversion Tool extension pack to emulate SQL Server Database Mail in PostgreSQL.
- [SQL Server to Amazon RDS SQL Server](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/SchemaConversionTool/latest/userguide/CHAP_Source.SQLServer.ToRDSSQLServer.md): This section of the AWS Schema Conversion Tool guide provides instructions to migrate data from Microsoft SQL Server to Amazon RDS for SQL Server using AWS SCT.

