- [Converting Amazon Redshift data](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/SchemaConversionTool/latest/userguide/CHAP_Converting.DW.RedshiftOpt.md): This section of the AWS Schema Conversion Tool User Guide shows you how to convert data from Amazon Redshift data warehouse.


